OL,3,GNEWSARepairs after train derailment set
OL,4,Ato cost #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of repairs following a train
OL,7,Fderailment in Lewes in August is
OL,8,Fexpected to reach more than #5m, it has
OL,9,Fbeen revealed.
OL,11,FTwo people were seriously injured after
OL,12,Fa service carrying about 150 passengers
OL,13,Fderailed close to the railway station,
OL,14,Fresulting in the route between Haywards
OL,15,FHeath and Lewes being closed for more
OL,16,Fthan two weeks.
OL,18,FIn response to a Freedom of Information
OL,19,Frequest, Network Rail said the
OL,20,F"anticipated final cost" of repairs
OL,21,Fwould be #5.4m.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
