OL,3,GNEWSARepairs after train derailment set
OL,4,Ato cost #5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe letter reads: "These costs will
OL,7,Fcover a range of activities associated
OL,8,Fwith recovery after an event like this,
OL,9,Fincluding hiring heavy plant machinery
OL,10,Fand infrastructure renewal and repair."
